      "validFrom": "2026-10-25",
      "description": "the reading (at least $0.75) and the construction (at least $0.25), each at its estimate × 3, quoted free before payment, charged as each delivers at its measured model cost × 3, never below model cost and payment fee, the rest refunded; a card order under $0.50 is charged and keeps $0.50"
     }
